<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“Come and dine,” the Lord is calling,</l><l>“Come and dine.”</l><l>When we eat and drink of Jesus all the time,</l><l>He becomes our life within,</l><l>And He fills us to the brim.</l><l>“Come and dine,” the Lord is calling,</l><l>“Come and dine.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
